'''Yui''' (Japanese: '''ユイ''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Yui can be found in the ninth and final statue in the main room. Players who defeat Yui will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Torrential Flood Deck==
'''Torrential Flood Deck''' (Japanese: '''おおあめこうずいデッキ''') is the deck played by Yui. The deck consists entirely of {{e|Water}} Pokémon and features the {{TCG ID|Promotional Card|Articuno|P03}} Legendary Card.

